        name = "Gamon Will Save Us!",
        source = "Gamon Will Save Us!",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Free Gamon and keep him alive through Nazgrim.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Free Gamon and keep him alive through Nazgrim.\n\n1. Enter Siege of Orgrimmar beneath the Vale's lake on Normal, Heroic or Mythic as permitted by this achievement's current tooltip. Do a full clear to reach the named boss; the Garrosh skip bypasses earlier encounters. Remove uncontrolled damage before any objective requiring the boss or adds to survive.\n\n2. After the Dark Shaman, find Gamon chained by the large tree near the Drag entrance. Clear his nearby enemies, free him and run ahead to kill the trash along his path so it cannot damage him.\n\n3. Let him progress toward General Nazgrim, then engage and kill Nazgrim while Gamon remains alive. Comments report credit even if Gamon's movement stalls near the Ragefire entrance, but allow his escort time before killing rather than assuming an unfreed Gamon counts.\n\n4. Do not wipe after bringing him into the encounter: Gamon can die and may not return for that saved attempt. A fast high-level kill avoids Nazgrim's repeated raid damage.",
