        difficultyReason = "Rescue all three groups before killing the Dark Shaman.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Rescue all three groups before killing the Dark Shaman.\n\n1. Enter Siege of Orgrimmar beneath the Vale's lake on Normal, Heroic or Mythic as permitted by this achievement's current tooltip. Do a full clear to reach the named boss; the Garrosh skip bypasses earlier encounters. Remove uncontrolled damage before any objective requiring the boss or adds to survive.\n\n2. After entering Orgrimmar, kill the Blind Blademaster in the entrance corridor so the stealthed Aysa can reach Ji Firepaw. Immediately kill Ji's hostile captors and allow his rescue; do not run straight past him to the bosses.\n\n3. In the bank, kill the hostile guard/jailer and loot the cage key. Use it on a cage containing LIVING prisoners, not an empty cage. Free the caged group before spending the only key on the wrong object.\n\n4. Find the unwilling neutral combatants being forced to fight. Control them without killing them and kill their hostile overseers. Preserve the friendly/neutral prisoners while clearing red-name enemies, then verify all three rescues and defeat the Kor'kron Dark Shaman.",
