        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Fourteen challenges include five-player transfers and repeated Thok jailer phases.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Fourteen challenges include five-player transfers and repeated Thok jailer phases.\n\n1. Bring five players with controlled damage and a tank for Go Long and the snail encounter; bring a druid for rooting Immerseus's puddles. Start a full Normal or Heroic Siege clear rather than taking the Garrosh shortcut. Mythic is optional for this meta.\n\n2. In the Vale, transform/kill ten Tears, pass Anguish among five players over 200 yards, prevent corruption fusions and avoid Manifestation Pride. At the city, preserve Galakras's allies, superheat/stomp six mines and complete all three prisoner rescues before Dark Shaman.\n\n3. Free and preserve Gamon through Nazgrim, transform the Skullsplitter with Malkorok's Breath, assign separate Mogu/Mantid killers in Spoils, and open the snail's three locks before letting it eat Thok. Ignore Blackfuse's belt weapons, claim three different Paragon mantles across clears, then have one Iron Star kill eighteen Warbringers before finishing Garrosh.\n\n4. Use each individual guide for its setup and check all fourteen criteria before repeating a saved boss. When the meta completes, claim and learn the Reins of Galakras. The old Cutting Edge/Ahead of the Curve feats are not requirements.",
