        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Complete the listed legacy raid encounters.\n\n1. Enter Siege of Orgrimmar at the map pin. Normal is sufficient for this wing-completion achievement; choose Heroic or Mythic instead if combining it with the corresponding boss achievements.\n\n2. Kill every boss on this wing's checklist: Immerseus; Fallen Protectors; Norushen; Sha of Pride. Enter beneath the Vale's lake, then clear the Vale wing, the siege of the city, the Underhold and Garrosh's inner sanctum. Use a full clear for any bosses before Garrosh; an entrance skip bypasses their credit.\n\n3. Start Galakras through your faction's leader, clear tower waves, kill tower guards and use the cannon to shoot Galakras down. For Spoils, open crates until each room reaches 50 energy, kill all spawned enemies including sparks, pull its lever, then cross using the chain or opened door. Finish all four rooms before their timers expire; unopened surplus crates are fine.\n\n4. Open the achievement and check each named boss. A full clear from the entrance covers the wing; using a final-boss skip leaves skipped criteria unfinished.",
