        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "A legacy boss kill; the selected raid difficulty must match.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A legacy boss kill; the selected raid difficulty must match.\n\n1. Outside the instance, right-click your character portrait and select Mythic raid difficulty. For the older raids also choose the legacy 10- or 25-player size. Enter Siege of Orgrimmar through the mapped entrance. Use a current high-level character rather than a Chromie Time leveling character.\n\n2. Enter beneath the Vale's lake, then clear the Vale wing, the siege of the city, the Underhold and Garrosh's inner sanctum. Use a full clear for any bosses before Garrosh; an entrance skip bypasses their credit. Your target is Immerseus. Kill preceding bosses needed to reach it; clearing a different wing in Raid Finder does not award this difficulty-specific achievement.\n\n3. Start Galakras through your faction's leader, clear tower waves, kill tower guards and use the cannon to shoot Galakras down. For Spoils, open crates until each room reaches 50 energy, kill all spawned enemies including sparks, pull its lever, then cross using the chain or opened door. Finish all four rooms before their timers expire; unopened surplus crates are fine.\n\n4. Confirm the named kill appears in the achievement criteria. Boss loot and repeat attempts are constrained by the raid's weekly lockout; do not expect resetting the instance to resurrect a boss already saved dead.",
