    [8531] = {
        achievementId = 8531,
        name = "Now We are the Paragon",
        source = "Now We are the Paragon",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Claim three different available mantles over three encounter completions.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Claim three different available mantles over three encounter completions.\n\n1. Enter Siege of Orgrimmar beneath the Vale's lake on Normal, Heroic or Mythic as permitted by this achievement's current tooltip. Do a full clear to reach the named boss; the Garrosh skip bypasses earlier encounters. Remove uncontrolled damage before any objective requiring the boss or adds to survive.\n\n2. Let the first Paragons land fully before attacking. Kill one, wait for its replacement to land, and continue at a controlled pace; killing the next active target before a replacement lands can leave the encounter stuck.\n\n3. During the encounter, click an eligible dead Paragon to take its mantle. Only ONE mantle may be claimed per player per fight, and available corpses depend on your role: Rik'kal and Kaz'tik are flexible choices; damage specs also have Skeer, Hisek, Ka'roz and Kil'ruk. Check that you gained its temporary title/extra action.\n\n4. Finish the Paragons to record that mantle. Repeat on two more completions and choose a DIFFERENT uncredited mantle each time. Normal, Heroic and Mythic have separate Siege lockouts, so three difficulties on the same character can finish this within one week; otherwise return after resets.",
