        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Prevent unleashed corruption from reaching the Amalgam.\n\n1. Enter Siege of Orgrimmar beneath the Vale's lake on Normal, Heroic or Mythic as permitted by this achievement's current tooltip. Do a full clear to reach the named boss; the Garrosh skip bypasses earlier encounters. Remove uncontrolled damage before any objective requiring the boss or adds to survive.\n\n2. Start Norushen's Amalgam of Corruption encounter and kill the boss promptly at high level. You do not need to send damage dealers into personal test orbs for this legacy burst route.\n\n3. If small corruption adds do spawn, intercept their path/beam and kill them before they fuse with the boss. Avoid the sweeping beam while finishing. No unleashed corruption may reach the Amalgam during the encounter.",
