        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A quick boss kill for accounts that already have sanctuary access.\n\n1. Check account access before traveling: the original Pandaria legendary cloak unlock OR the Infinite Power XII unlock earned during Pandaria Remix permits entry. Those historical unlocks are not currently earnable by a new account; ordinary Timeless Isle access alone does not bypass Ordos's restriction.\n\n2. If your account is eligible, follow the uphill path from 46,78, cross the bridge at 56.39,57.87 and approach the broken crossing at 52.64,46.76. Eligible characters are carried across automatically; recent reports say activating a cloak-effect toy is unnecessary.\n\n3. Reach Ordos around 55,18.1, tag and defeat him, then check credit. Being summoned or gliding into the restricted courtyard on an ineligible account does not substitute for the account unlock and can teleport you out.",
