        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Defeat four rotating world bosses at the same court.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Defeat four rotating world bosses at the same court.\n\n1. Go to the central Celestial Court at 38,55. This achievement uses ordinary character combat against the four large Celestials, not the Celestial Tournament pet battles.\n\n2. Engage and defeat the active Celestial, then wait for the next to enter the arena. Personally tag Chi-Ji, Niuzao, Xuen and Yu'lon and confirm all four named criteria.\n\n3. Continue through the rotation until every missing boss has appeared. The weekly loot reward is separate: limited loot does not stop the other Celestial kills counting toward this achievement.",
