        name = "Unlimited Potential",
        source = "Unlimited Potential",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Bring a living Skullsplitter into Malkorok's Breath.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Bring a living Skullsplitter into Malkorok's Breath.\n\n1. Enter Siege of Orgrimmar beneath the Vale's lake on Normal, Heroic or Mythic as permitted by this achievement's current tooltip. Do a full clear to reach the named boss; the Garrosh skip bypasses earlier encounters. Remove uncontrolled damage before any objective requiring the boss or adds to survive.\n\n2. In the hallway BEFORE Malkorok, find the Corrupted Skullsplitter restrained by guards. Clear the path to the boss, kill only its guards and keep the Skullsplitter alive.\n\n3. Drag the Skullsplitter into Malkorok's room, body-pull the boss and stack the add on him. Put your back against the exit gate to limit knockups and avoid auto-attacking either target while waiting.\n\n4. Let Breath of Y'Shaarj hit the Skullsplitter and visibly transform it into a Corrupted Amalgamation. Only after the transformation kill Malkorok. Killing the transformed add is optional for credit; killing the untransformed Skullsplitter fails the setup.",
