        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Defeat legacy Garrosh on Heroic or Mythic with the matching faction.\n\n1. Use a Alliance character. Select Heroic or Mythic before entering Siege of Orgrimmar beneath the Vale's lake at the map pin. Normal is insufficient under the current difficulty names; old comments used the pre-Warlords names.\n\n2. Clear through Siegecrafter Blackfuse and the Paragons to Garrosh. If your character is eligible for the entrance scroll's Garrosh skip, it can shorten a title-only run; do a full clear when you still need earlier bosses.\n\n3. Defeat Garrosh through his transitions and final phase, then verify this faction's title achievement. This ordinary title remains available even though the original Ahead of the Curve and Cutting Edge feats have closed.",
