        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A named creature checklist with an elevated outer-sanctuary stop.\n\n1. Travel to Timeless Isle and work this circuit by name. These thirty-two criteria are ordinary creature types; the rare-spawn checklist belongs to Timeless Champion. At a current high character level the fights are simple.\n\n2. At 25,29, find and kill: Jademist Dancer. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n3. At 25,51, find and kill: Great Turtle Hatchling; Great Turtle; Elder Great Turtle (offshore). Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n4. At 43.6,40.7, find and kill: Cavern entrance - Foreboding Flame; Damp Shambler. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n5. At 31,45, find and kill: Windfeather Chick; Windfeather Nestkeeper; Brilliant Windfeather; Ironfur Herdling; Ironfur Grazer; Ironfur Great Bull. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n6. At 47,59, find and kill: Primal Stalker. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n7. At 29,71, find and kill: Death Adder. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n8. At 52,66, find and kill: Crag Stalker. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n9. At 59,65, find and kill: Eroded Cliffdweller. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n10. At 62,74, find and kill: Gulp Frog. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n11. At 37,77, find and kill: Spectral Brewmaster; Spectral Windwalker; Spectral Mistweaver. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n12. At 39,83, find and kill: Spotted Swarmer. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n13. At 35,84, find and kill: Ancient Spineclaw - offshore. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n14. At 54,79, find and kill: Ordon Fire-Watcher; Ordon Candlekeeper; Ordon Oathguard. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n15. At 70,55, find and kill: Ashleaf Sprite. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n16. At 68,39, find and kill: Burning Berserker. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n17. At 67,57, find and kill: Crimsonscale Firestorm - flying. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n18. At 58,58, find and kill: Blazebound Chanter; Eternal Kilnmaster. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n19. At 48,39, find and kill: Molten Guardian. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n20. At 44,26, find and kill: High Priest of Ordos - outer sanctuary. Check each named criterion before moving on.\n\n21. For the outer sanctuary creatures, use a non-damaging pull or Fruit Basket on a low-flying Highwind Albatross near the Celestial Court, let it carry you up, and defeat it over Ruby Lake. Descend to the outer grounds. The outer western court is usable without Ordos's restricted inner-courtyard unlock.",
