        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Thirty-one rares include random replacements, events and elevated spawns.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Thirty-one rares include random replacements, events and elevated spawns.\n\n1. Prepare an island circuit and personally tag every named rare. Some replace ordinary creatures and others require an event; repeatedly waiting at the map point alone will not spawn those. Use a non-damaging taunt or Fruit Basket to board an albatross near 33,54 for elevated areas.\n\n2. Emerald Gander near 31,45: Kill ordinary cranes and inspect their replacement spawns. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n3. Ironfur Steelhorn near 31,45: Check ordinary oxen's replacement spawns. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n4. Great Turtle Furyshell near 25,51: Search the western turtle shoreline and its replacements. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n5. Gu'chi the Swarmbringer near 41.1,81.2: Patrol around Old Pi'jiu and its southern shore. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n6. Zesqua near 47.6,87.3: Search the southeastern village shoreline. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n7. Zhu-Gon the Sour near 37.4,77.4: When Skunky Beer barrels appear, collect beer and defeat the event's angry spirits until Zhu-Gon spawns. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n8. Chelon near 25.3,35.8: Click the Conspicuously Empty Shell north of the Horde landing. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n9. Karkanos near 33.9,85.1: Speak to Fin Longpaw at the southern fishing jetty to summon him. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n10. Cranegnasher near 44.5,69: Lead a living Fishgorged Crane onto the dead crane at this spot. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n11. Spelurk near 59,48.8: Find a lost pandaren artifact and use its granted ability to break open the Mysterious Den's blocked entrance. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n12. Rattleskew near 60.6,87.2: At the submerged wreck, wait for Captain Zvezdan's event and help defeat its attackers until Rattleskew appears. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n13. Spirit of Jadefire near 43.6,40.7: Enter the Cavern of Lost Spirits and inspect its inner loops. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n14. Leafmender near 67.3,44.1: Check the leafy tree beside the uphill path. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n15. Bufo near 64,70.6: Search the frog-filled Croaking Hollow. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n16. Garnia near 64.5,27.1: Ride a Highwind Albatross to Ruby Lake and drop into the water. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n17. Tsavo'ka near 54.6,44.3: Enter the small tiger cave. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n18. Monstrous Spineclaw near 21.8,31.4: Kill Ancient Spineclaws along the coast; the rare can replace a respawning ordinary crab. Keep cycling the same spawn points. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n19. Imperial Python near 30.5,49: Kill Death Adders and revisit their spawn points for the rare replacement; also search the southwestern snake circuit. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n20. Stinkbraid near 71.5,80.7: Board the southeast pirate ship and inspect its upper deck. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n21. Rock Moss near 45.4,29.4: Clear Damp Shamblers inside the Cavern of Lost Spirits and check the lower chamber for the rare. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n22. Watcher Osu near 57.5,77.1: Search Firewalker Ruins. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n23. Jakur of Ordon near 52,83.4: Search the southern part of Firewalker Ruins. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n24. Champion of the Black Flame near 58,59: Patrol between the upper bridges. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n25. Cinderfall near 54,52.4: Check the broken bridge ledge; avoid falling after the kill. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n26. Urdur the Cauterizer near 45.4,26.6: Search the outer western sanctuary court. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n27. Flintlord Gairan near 68,39: Search the eastern yaungol grounds outside the sanctuary. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n28. Huolon near 67,57: Watch the eastern sky and the bridge route; tag the flying black serpent. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n29. Golganarr near 62.5,63.5: Check Red Stone Run; this spawn can require a long wait. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n30. Evermaw near 25,25: Search offshore around the entire island; this pin is only a starting point for the swimming patrol. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n31. Dread Ship Vazuvius near 26.5,27.8: Loot Mist-Filled Spirit Lantern from Evermaw, use it at the Misty Strand grave and defeat the summoned ship. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n32. Archiereus of Flame near 34.8,35.7: Buy a Scroll of Challenge from Mistweaver Ku at Celestial Court and use the Three-Breeze Terrace challenge stone, or find the natural outer-sanctuary spawn. Defeat the named rare and check its criterion.\n\n33. The outer sanctuary can be reached by albatross/Ruby Lake without entering Ordos's restricted inner courtyard. Repeat missing spawns on later visits; one kill of each of the thirty-one names completes the checklist.",
