    [8715] = {
        achievementId = 8715,
        name = "Emperor Shaohao",
        source = "Emperor Shaohao",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Kill Ordon enemies or use the matching reputation commendation.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Kill Ordon enemies or use the matching reputation commendation.\n\n1. Travel to the Timeless Isle and meet Emperor Shaohao at the Celestial Court. The reputation farm itself can begin with eligible Ordon yaungol; a complete island campaign is unnecessary.\n\n2. Kill reputation-awarding yaungol at Firewalker Ruins and the Blazing Way, looting them as you go. Ordinary frogs and island wildlife may drop coins but do not replace Ordon reputation kills. Rotate the two accessible lower areas as enemies respawn.\n\n3. If your account has Ordon Sanctuary access, its stronger enemies provide another farm. That old account unlock is OPTIONAL: the lower-area route works without a legendary cloak. A Scroll of Challenge summons extra enemies at Three-Breeze Terrace, but spends Timeless Coins.\n\n4. Continue to Exalted, or use the matching Emperor Shaohao commendation when available through Pandaria Timewalking. The Heavenly Golden Cloud Serpent additionally costs 100,000 Timeless Coins; those coins are not required just for this reputation achievement.",
