        name = "Candlekeeper",
        source = "Candlekeeper",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Earn 10 Bloody Coins from eligible killing blows.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Earn 10 Bloody Coins from eligible killing blows.\n\n1. Buy Fire-Watcher's Oath (102463) for 100 Timeless Coins from Speaker Gulan at 74.9,44.9. This is the convenient battleground route; the 1,000-coin Censer is an alternative restricted to Timeless Isle.\n\n2. Activate the Oath before fighting and reapply after its ten-minute duration or after dying. Obtain the KILLING BLOW on eligible enemies; participating in an honorable kill without the final hit is insufficient.\n\n3. Current 2026 Retail comments confirm Training Grounds battleground bots give Bloody Coins. Queue for that mode, keep the Oath active and focus finishing damaged enemies. Ordinary battleground opponents are another route. Verify your Bloody Coin counter rises before committing to a long session.\n\n4. Continue until the achievement's earned-coin counter reaches 10. Spending coins does not erase the earned total. If using the censer instead, heal after activation and respect a victim's Sacrificed to Ordos cooldown rather than repeatedly killing an ineligible target.",
