        difficultyReason = "Eat seven different outdoor food objects.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Eat seven different outdoor food objects.\n\n1. Click and consume Ripe Crispfruit under trees around Celestial Court and Sand-Covered Eggs along the western beaches.\n\n2. Eat a Charged Crystal at Red Stone Run's rock bases, then a Huge Yak Roast in Firewalker Ruins.\n\n3. Eat a Roasted Seed under an Ashleaf Sprite's tree in the Blazing Way. Consume a Fire Poppy in the OUTER sanctuary grounds; an albatross ride to Ruby Lake followed by a descent reaches this area without Ordos access.\n\n4. Drink Southsea Firebrew from the southeast pirate ship or the small boat by Croaking Hollow. Check all seven criteria; each outdoor interactable must be consumed, rather than merely visited.",
