    [8728] = {
        achievementId = 8728,
        name = "Going To Need A Bigger Bag",
        source = "Going To Need A Bigger Bag",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Fifty-six distinct loot results include rare spawns, rare drops and a mount.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Fifty-six distinct loot results include rare spawns, rare drops and a mount.\n\n1. Treat this as a LOOT checklist, not a collection-ownership checklist. Check your current criteria first and farm missing drops. Buying a caged pet does not count as looting its original teaching item.\n\n2. Plan a repeated circuit around the sources below. Timeless rares can drop achievement items on repeat kills; the reduced coin reward after a first kill does not create a universal one-kill-per-day item lockout. Rare replacements and rare item drops can take a very long time.\n\n3. Sunken Treasure near 40,92: obtain Cursed Swabby Helmet. Kill Cursed Hozen Swabbies for the key, enter the southern wreck and open its weekly chest.\n\n4. Karkanos near 33.9,85.1: obtain Giant Purse of Timeless Coins. Ask Fin Longpaw at the fishing jetty to summon Karkanos, then kill and loot him.\n\n5. Ordon Candlekeepers near 54,79: obtain Battle Horn. Farm ordinary candlekeepers at Firewalker Ruins.\n\n6. Burning Berserkers / Ashleaf Sprites near 68,39: obtain Forager's Gloves; Big Bag of Herbs (106130). Farm the correct ordinary yaungol/sprites. The old Huge Bag of Herbs (87219) does NOT fill Big Bag of Herbs.\n\n7. Gulp Frogs near 62,74: obtain Overgrown Lilypad criterion (current item name: Wilted Lilypad, 86580). Farm ordinary frogs in Croaking Hollow.\n\n8. Great Turtle Furyshell / Chelon near 25,51: obtain Hardened Shell. Kill western-shore rares. Click Chelon's Conspicuously Empty Shell to summon that option.\n\n9. Spectral villagers near 37,77: obtain Thick Pi'jiu Brew; Bubbling Pi'jiu Brew; Misty Pi'jiu Brew. Kill Spectral Brewmasters for Thick, Windwalkers for Bubbling, and Mistweavers for Misty.\n\n10. Jakur of Ordon near 52,83.4: obtain Warning Sign. Kill the named southern Firewalker Ruins rare.\n\n11. Ordon Oathguards near 54,79: obtain Warped Warning Sign. Farm ordinary oathguards; the separate Warning Sign comes from Jakur.\n\n12. High Priests of Ordos near 44,26: obtain Ash-Covered Horn. Farm priests in the outer sanctuary; the restricted Ordos courtyard is unnecessary.\n\n13. Rattleskew near 60.6,87.2: obtain Captain Zvezdan's Lost Leg. Wait at the submerged wreck for the Captain Zvezdan event, help defeat attackers, then kill Rattleskew.\n\n14. Molten Guardians near 48,39: obtain Cauterizing Core. Farm the ordinary molten giants in the outer sanctuary.\n\n15. Spelurk near 59,48.8: obtain Cursed Talisman. Use a lost pandaren artifact's granted ability to break the Mysterious Den cave-in, then kill Spelurk inside.\n\n16. Cavern of Lost Spirits near 43.6,40.7: obtain Crystal of Insanity; Strange Glowing Mushroom; Golden Moss; Glowing Blue Ash; Glowing Green Ash; Jadefire Spirit; Ominous Flame. Enter the cave. Loot Eerie Crystals for Crystal of Insanity; kill Damp Shamblers/Rock Moss for the mushroom, Rock Moss for Golden Moss, Foreboding Flames/Cinderfall for blue ash, Spirit of Jadefire for green ash and Jadefire Spirit, and ordinary Foreboding Flames for Ominous Flame. Clear shamblers to encourage Rock Moss's replacement spawn.\n\n17. Watcher Osu near 57.5,77.1: obtain Ashen Stone. Kill the named Firewalker Ruins rare.\n\n18. Eternal Kilnmasters / Ordon Fire-Watchers near 58,58: obtain Eternal Kiln; Blazing Sigil of Ordos. Kill Eternal Kilnmasters for both Eternal Kiln and Blazing Sigil; Ordon Fire-Watchers are another source of the sigil. Preserve loot eligibility when another player tags.\n\n19. Urdur the Cauterizer / outer sanctuary near 45.4,26.6: obtain Sunset Stone; Ordon Ceremonial Robes. Kill Urdur for Sunset Stone; fire-watchers, kilnmasters and their matching rares can supply the robes.\n\n20. Molten Guardians near 48,39: obtain Blizzard Stone. Kill ordinary guardians in the outer grounds.\n\n21. Zesqua near 47.6,87.3: obtain Rain Stone. Kill the southern shoreline rare.\n\n22. Cinderfall near 54,52.4: obtain Falling Flame. Check the ledge before the broken bridge; loot carefully without falling.\n\n23. Champion of the Black Flame near 58,59: obtain Blackflame Daggers. Kill the patrolling rare between the upper bridges.\n\n24. Flintlord Gairan near 68,39: obtain Ordon Death Chime. Find and kill the named yaungol rare outside the sanctuary.\n\n25. Dread Ship Vazuvius near 26.5,27.8: obtain Rime of the Time-Lost Mariner. Kill Evermaw offshore for Mist-Filled Spirit Lantern, use it at the Misty Strand grave and defeat the ship.\n\n26. Ancient / Monstrous Spineclaws near 21.8,31.4: obtain Scuttler's Shell; Spineclaw Crab. Clear ordinary crabs along western shores and revisit replacements. Scuttler's Shell can come from ordinary crabs; Spineclaw Crab requires the rare Monstrous Spineclaw and then a successful pet drop.\n\n27. Death Adders / Imperial Python near 30.5,49: obtain Partially-Digested Meal; Death Adder Hatchling. Ordinary adders can supply the meal; kill them repeatedly to roll an Imperial Python replacement for the hatchling.\n\n28. Spotted Swarmers / Gu'chi near 41.1,81.2: obtain Sticky Silkworm Goo; Swarmling of Gu'chi. Kill ordinary swarmers for goo and the named Gu'chi for the pet.\n\n29. Ashleaf Sprites / Leafmender near 70,55: obtain Faintly-Glowing Herb; Ashleaf Spriteling. Sprites and Leafmender can supply the herb; kill Leafmender at 67.3,44.1 for the pet.\n\n30. Jademist Dancers near 25.5,29.2: obtain Condensed Jademist; Jademist Dancer. Farm the ordinary hostile shoreline elementals for both drops.\n\n31. Brilliant Windfeathers / Emerald Gander near 31,45: obtain Windfeather Plume. Kill the adult cranes and the rare replacement.\n\n32. Crimsonscale Firestorms / Huolon near 67,57: obtain Quivering Firestorm Egg; Reins of the Thundering Onyx Cloud Serpent. Ordinary flying serpents and Huolon can drop the egg; Huolon supplies the mount.\n\n33. Primal / Crag Stalkers and Tsavo'ka near 47,59: obtain Pristine Stalker Hide. Farm the ordinary tigers or the named cave rare.\n\n34. Eroded Cliffdwellers / Golganarr near 59,65: obtain Odd Polished Stone; Glinting Pile of Stone. Farm ordinary rock giants; recent Retail reports confirm both can come from them, so waiting only for Golganarr is unnecessary.\n\n35. Master Kukuru's cave near 58,43: obtain Bonkers. Buy his chest keys with Timeless Coins and open the cave's chests. Each key is another chance, not a guaranteed pet.\n\n36. Bufo near 64,70.6: obtain Gulp Froglet. Kill the named rare in Croaking Hollow.\n\n37. Zhu-Gon the Sour near 37.4,77.4: obtain Skunky Alemental. Complete Old Pi'jiu's Skunky Beer event: collect barrels and defeat angry spirits until the rare appears, then loot him.\n\n38. Neverending Spritewood event near 44.5,72.5: obtain Dandelion Frolicker. Click the event crystal when active and kill the resulting Scary Sprites during the event.\n\n39. Crane Nests near 31,45: obtain Azure Crane Chick. Loot nests among the forest's trees; the pet is a rare nest result.\n\n40. Garnia near 64.5,27.1: obtain Ruby Droplet. Use a non-damaging albatross pull near 33,54, ride to Ruby Lake and kill the bird over water. Kill Garnia at the lake.\n\n41. With a party, keep original rare/epic drops UNLEARNED and UNEQUIPPED while checking their loot-trade eligibility. A 2026 report confirms many eligible original drops can be traded to a party member who was present for the kill, then counted after that recipient relogs. This varies by item and does not apply to an Auction House cage; verify credit before consuming the item.\n\n42. Check all fifty-six criteria after each circuit. Do not substitute Huge Bag of Herbs for item 106130, a different sign for the two sign criteria, or owned Remix rewards for confirmed Retail loot credit. The ordinary creature kills, named rare kills and treasure achievements are useful alongside this route but do not themselves fill a missing item drop.",
        stepCount = 42,
        waypoints = {
